#  ---- Troubleshooting ----------------------------------------------
#  • Python 3.14 installed?    → numpy has no wheel for 3.14 yet.
#                                 Install Python 3.12 instead.
#  • "pip not found"           → make sure Python is in PATH, try "py -m pip"
#  • "go not found"            → reinstall Go, restart terminal
#  • sklearn build fails       → pip install scikit-learn==1.5.2
#    (missing compiler)          (1.6+ needs Visual Studio Build Tools)
#  • "Can't get attribute"     → delete model.joblib and retrain locally.
#    in app.py                   pickle files are not cross-platform.
#  • Frontend can't connect    → make sure both backend (8080) AND ML (8081)
#                                 are running
#  • "connect to PostgreSQL"   → check PostgreSQL is running (pgAdmin / Services)
#  • torch huge download       → you missed the --index-url flag in step 3
